cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Pavan Krovvidi FingerWave Neural Network, please cite it as below."
title: "Pavan Krovvidi FingerWave Neural Network: A Biologically Inspired, Boundary-Seeded Neural PDE"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Krovvidi"
    given-names: "Pavan Kumar"
    email: "pavank9848@gmail.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-3286-7173"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pavankrovvidi/pavan-krovvidi-fingerwave"
abstract: >-
  A biologically inspired neural architecture modelled on fingerprint formation.
  A confidence-seeded, stable reaction-diffusion PDE propagates information from
  reliable regions into uncertain ones, and a differentiable topological loss
  conserves cores and deltas. On 500 synthetic degraded fingerprints it reduced
  topological errors from 5.8% to 4.0% versus a same-size U-Net (3 seeds).
keywords:
  - FingerWave
  - Pavan Krovvidi
  - biologically inspired AI
  - neural PDE
  - fingerprint
  - topology
  - reaction-diffusion
